Package: ms-calculator
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Windows Calculator engine with a native Qt interface
 A Linux port of the open source Windows Calculator. The arbitrary precision
 engine (CalcManager) is the upstream code, built unchanged. The interface is
 rebuilt with Qt 6 Widgets.
 .
 It offers Standard, Scientific and Programmer modes, date calculation,
 history, memory, light and dark themes, and the upstream translations of
 engine messages and date strings.
 .
 This is an unofficial build. It is not made or endorsed by Microsoft.
